       {
        "text": "Also $(2x-7)^2 > 0$ for every $x$ in the domain ($x \\ne 3.5$), so $g'(x) < 0$ always."
       },
       {
        "text": "So $g'(x) \\ne 0$ for all $x$ in the domain: $g$ has no local maximum or minimum points."
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "final": "g'(x) = -\\frac{6}{(2x-7)^2} < 0 \\text{ for all } x \\text{ in the domain, so there are no turning points}"
